  "abstract": "We give a simple construction of Markov traces for Iwahori\u2013Hecke algebras associated with the crystallographic Coxeter groups of types An, Bn and Dn.I nt y p e sB and D, it is new and generalises a known construction in typeA employing symmetric polynomials in multiplicative Jucys\u2013Murphy elements.",
